	column RosterArea = ```
			IF(
			    FactRostersVisualCare[LocationId] = -1, 
			    IF(FactRostersVisualCare[CarerId] = -1,
			        CALCULATE(SELECTEDVALUE('Dim Clients'[Area]), CROSSFILTER('Dim Clients'[ClientId], FactRostersVisualCare[ClientId], Both)),
			        CALCULATE(SELECTEDVALUE(DimWorkforceVisualCare[Area]), CROSSFILTER(DimWorkforceVisualCare[CarerId], FactRostersVisualCare[CarerId], Both))),
			    CALCULATE(SELECTEDVALUE(DimRosterLocationsVisualCare[Area]), CROSSFILTER(FactRostersVisualCare[LocationId], DimRosterLocationsVisualCare[LocationId], Both))
			)
			```
